{"seq":1,"slug":"winning-close-settlement","title":"中标判定与成交结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-close-settle/winning-close-settlement","wordCount":1869,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"中标判定与成交结算\">中标判定与成交结算</h1><p>落槌不是一个瞬间，而是一条横跨多个服务的链路：判定赢家、锁定成交价、生成订单、扣减库存、冻结/释放保证金、通知双方、写账。这条链路里任何一段失败，都会留下「拍卖说成交了、订单没生成」或「订单生成了、库存没扣」的分裂状态。本章讲的就是如何把这条链路做成<strong>可重入、可对账、最终一致</strong>的流程，而不是一个祈祷不失败的大事务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把两个词分清：**判定（close）**只回答「谁赢了、成交价多少」，是纯计算；**结算（settle）**是把判定结果变成有经济后果的事实，涉及多个服务。判定可以幂等地重算，结算必须靠补偿与重试收敛。</p>\n<p>UCC §2-328 给出了判定完成的时点：成交在拍卖人宣布时完成，通常即落槌之时；若恰在落槌时有出价到达，拍卖人可选择重开竞价或确认给先前的出价者（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/ucc/2/2-328\">Cornell LII, UCC §2-328</a>）。这条规则在系统里翻译成一句硬要求：<strong>落槌必须是一个带确定输入的唯一判定，任何「重新落槌」都必须是新版判定，不能覆盖旧判定的历史</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[close_time 到期] --&gt; B[判定: 取有效出价最高者]&#10;  B --&gt; C{达到保留价?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[终态 reserve_not_met]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[写入 hammer 事件&lt;br/&gt;含 winner 与 price]&#10;  E --&gt; F[生成订单 幂等键]&#10;  F --&gt; G[扣减库存 / 冻结]&#10;  G --&gt; H{成功?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[通知双方 进入履约]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[补偿: 释放占用&lt;br/&gt;标记待人工处理]&#10;  D --&gt; K[进入流拍处置]\">graph TD\n  A[close_time 到期] --&gt; B[判定: 取有效出价最高者]\n  B --&gt; C{达到保留价?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[终态 reserve_not_met]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[写入 hammer 事件&lt;br/&gt;含 winner 与 price]\n  E --&gt; F[生成订单 幂等键]\n  F --&gt; G[扣减库存 / 冻结]\n  G --&gt; H{成功?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[通知双方 进入履约]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[补偿: 释放占用&lt;br/&gt;标记待人工处理]\n  D --&gt; K[进入流拍处置]</pre><h2 id=\"落槌判定的确定性\">落槌判定的确定性</h2><h3 id=\"判定输入\">判定输入</h3><p>判定必须只依赖一份确定的输入：拍卖参数（起拍价、保留价、加价阶梯）、有效出价集合、以及买断事件。任何依赖「当前时间」「当前在线人数」「此刻的汇率」的判定规则都会破坏可重算性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定输出\">判定输出</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;auction_id&quot;: &quot;A-77412&quot;,&#10;  &quot;closed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T10:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;hammer&quot;,&#10;  &quot;winner_id&quot;: &quot;U-3391&quot;,&#10;  &quot;final_price&quot;: 452.0,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;derivation&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;highest_max&quot;: 480.0,&#10;    &quot;second_max&quot;: 447.0,&#10;    &quot;increment&quot;: 5.0,&#10;    &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;min(highest_max, second_max + increment)&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;reserve_met&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;input_digest&quot;: &quot;sha256:9f2c...&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"auction_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A-77412\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"closed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T10:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hammer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"winner_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"U-3391\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"final_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">452.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"derivation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"highest_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">480.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"second_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">447.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"increment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min(highest_max, second_max + increment)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reserve_met\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"input_digest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:9f2c...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>derivation</code> 与 <code>input_digest</code> 是给事后复核用的：任何一次纠纷都可以用同一份输入重算出同一个 <code>final_price</code> 与 <code>input_digest</code> 比对。这不是过度设计，而是拍卖这种「价格由规则推导而非由一方设定」的业态里最低限度的事后可验证性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"边界-落槌瞬间到达的出价\">边界：落槌瞬间到达的出价</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>到达时刻</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>close_time 之前，且已在事件流中</td>\n<td>计入有效集合</td>\n<td>正常参与判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>close_time 之前到达，但延时已将 close_time 推后</td>\n<td>计入，且拍卖未结束</td>\n<td>延时先于判定生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定已提交后到达</td>\n<td>拒绝，返回已结束</td>\n<td>判定即终态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二条要求延时写入与判定判定之间必须线性化，两者共享同一把版本锁，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/anti-sniping-time-extend\">反狙击自动延时</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算链路与事务边界\">结算链路与事务边界</h2><h3 id=\"为什么不能用分布式事务\">为什么不能用分布式事务</h3><p>结算天然横跨订单、库存、支付、账务四个服务，各自有独立数据库。跨库两阶段提交在这个规模上不可用，正确的模式是把整条链路建模成<strong>一串本地事务</strong>，每个服务原子地改自己的库并发出下一跳事件；某一步违反业务规则时执行补偿事务回滚先前步骤——这就是 Saga 模式（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/saga.html\">microservices.io, Saga</a>）。</p>\n<p>Saga 的两个已知代价必须写进设计：回滚逻辑要显式实现（没有数据库替你回滚），且中间态对外可见（缺少 ACID 隔离）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用-outbox-保证-改库-与-发事件-原子\">用 Outbox 保证「改库」与「发事件」原子</h3><p>Saga 参与者的核心难题是：既要改自己的库，又要可靠地发出下一跳消息，而数据库与消息中间件之间没有共同事务。Transactional Outbox 模式的解法是把消息写进与业务数据<strong>同一个库的同一张表</strong>，再由一个中继进程把它投递出去，从而借用本地事务的原子性（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/saga.html\">microservices.io, Saga</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE outbox (&#10;  id           BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  aggregate_id BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  event_type   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  payload      JSONB       NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  dispatched_at TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  attempts     INT         NOT NULL DEFAULT 0&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX outbox_pending&#10;  ON outbox (id) WHERE dispatched_at IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> outbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  aggregate_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload      JSONB       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dispatched_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempts     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> outbox_pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbox (id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispatched_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结算事务的写法固定为「业务写入 + outbox 写入 + 提交」，中继进程负责把 <code>dispatched_at IS NULL</code> 的行投递出去。这里唯一需要的保证是<strong>投递至少一次</strong>，重复投递由下游的幂等消费吸收。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等键与去重\">幂等键与去重</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE settlement_step (&#10;  auction_id  BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  step        TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  idem_key    TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  applied_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (auction_id, step)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> settlement_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auction_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  step        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idem_key    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  applied_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (auction_id, step)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>以 <code>(auction_id, step)</code> 为主键，让「生成订单」「扣减库存」「冻结保证金」各自最多生效一次。重复消息到达时插入冲突即证明已处理，直接确认并跳过——这就是幂等消费，其定义是「即使同一份消息被接收多次，系统也产生同样的结果」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idempotence\">Wikipedia, Idempotence</a>）。注意该条目的关键词：<strong>要唯一标识受影响的资源</strong>，否则重复请求仍会持续改变状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算状态机与补偿\">结算状态机与补偿</h2><h3 id=\"状态定义\">状态定义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可迁移到</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>closed</td>\n<td>已判定，未开始结算</td>\n<td>settling / void</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>settling</td>\n<td>结算进行中</td>\n<td>settled / compensating</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>settled</td>\n<td>订单、库存、账务全部落定</td>\n<td>completed / refunding</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>compensating</td>\n<td>补偿进行中</td>\n<td>closed(重试) / failed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>failed</td>\n<td>补偿耗尽，需人工</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"补偿动作\">补偿动作</h3><p>补偿不是「删掉刚才做的事」，而是执行一个语义相反的本地事务：订单改为取消、库存解冻、保证金退回。每个正向步骤都必须有一一对应的补偿，且补偿自身也必须幂等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;saga&quot;: &quot;auction_settlement&quot;,&#10;  &quot;steps&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;create_order&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;cancel_order&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;reserve_stock&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;release_stock&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;block_deposit&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;unblock_deposit&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;issue_invoice&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;void_invoice&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;notify_parties&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"saga\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auction_settlement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"create_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cancel_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reserve_stock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"release_stock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"block_deposit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unblock_deposit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"issue_invoice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"void_invoice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify_parties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后一步 <code>notify_parties</code> 的补偿是 <code>none</code>：通知不可撤回，因此它必须排在所有可补偿步骤之后。这条排序原则——<strong>不可逆步骤永远最后</strong>——是 Saga 设计里最省事也最容易违反的一条。</p>\n<h3 id=\"超时与悬挂\">超时与悬挂</h3><p>结算步骤超时不能简单当作失败：超时只说明「没收到回应」，不代表「什么都没发生」。正确做法是<strong>先查询后重试</strong>——用步骤的幂等键反查该步骤是否已生效，再决定补偿还是推进。这与支付回调的处理是同一模式，与 <a href=\"auction-deposit-default\">拍卖保证金与买家违约</a> 共享。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常</th>\n<th>错误处置</th>\n<th>正确处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扣库存超时</td>\n<td>触发补偿、退货</td>\n<td>反查幂等键，确认后才补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复投递事件</td>\n<td>再执行一次正向步骤</td>\n<td>幂等键冲突即跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补偿本身失败</td>\n<td>忽略</td>\n<td>重试 + 死信告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间态可见</td>\n<td>假设事务隔离</td>\n<td>给中间态定义合法对外语义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对账\">对账</h2><h3 id=\"三层对账\">三层对账</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>比对对象</th>\n<th>频度</th>\n<th>发现的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部一致性</td>\n<td>判定结果 vs 出价事件重放</td>\n<td>每场</td>\n<td>判定与实际出价不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨服务</td>\n<td>拍卖终态 vs 订单数量</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>漏单、重单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金</td>\n<td>订单应付 vs 保证金/账务流水</td>\n<td>日终</td>\n<td>金额不符、冻结未释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一层是最便宜也最有效的：把每场拍卖的 <code>input_digest</code> 与重放结果比对，不一致即告警。它能在结算之前就抓到判定 bug，而不是等到资金对账才发现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对账产出\">对账产出</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;job&quot;: &quot;auction_reconcile_daily&quot;,&#10;  &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28&quot;,&#10;  &quot;counters&quot;: { &quot;auctions&quot;: 12840, &quot;closed&quot;: 9112, &quot;unsold&quot;: 3408, &quot;void&quot;: 320 },&#10;  &quot;mismatches&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;order_missing&quot;, &quot;auction_id&quot;: &quot;A-77190&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;replay_saga&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;digest_diff&quot;, &quot;auction_id&quot;: &quot;A-77033&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;manual_review&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"job\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auction_reconcile_daily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"counters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"auctions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12840</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"closed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9112</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unsold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3408</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"void\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">320</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mismatches\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_missing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"auction_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A-77190\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"replay_saga\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"digest_diff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"auction_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A-77033\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manual_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对账作业本身必须幂等且可重复跑：任何一天的结果都应该只由当天的输入决定，重跑不产生新的副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>判定（纯计算、可重算）与结算（多服务、需补偿）必须分开设计。</li>\n<li>落槌判定只依赖确定输入，输出必须带推导过程与输入摘要，以支持事后复核。</li>\n<li>结算链路用 Saga 建模成串行本地事务，用 Outbox 保证改库与发事件原子。</li>\n<li>幂等消费需要唯一标识受影响的资源，主键冲突即证明已处理。</li>\n<li>每个正向步骤必须有语义相反的补偿，且不可逆步骤（通知）排在最后。</li>\n<li>超时先查询后重试，不能等同于失败；这是支付与保证金场景的共同纪律。</li>\n<li>三层对账里，「判定结果 vs 出价重放」最便宜也最早暴露问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"中标判定与成交结算","id":"中标判定与成交结算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"落槌判定的确定性","id":"落槌判定的确定性"},{"level":3,"text":"判定输入","id":"判定输入"},{"level":3,"text":"判定输出","id":"判定输出"},{"level":3,"text":"边界：落槌瞬间到达的出价","id":"边界-落槌瞬间到达的出价"},{"level":2,"text":"结算链路与事务边界","id":"结算链路与事务边界"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能用分布式事务","id":"为什么不能用分布式事务"},{"level":3,"text":"用 Outbox 保证「改库」与「发事件」原子","id":"用-outbox-保证-改库-与-发事件-原子"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等键与去重","id":"幂等键与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"结算状态机与补偿","id":"结算状态机与补偿"},{"level":3,"text":"状态定义","id":"状态定义"},{"level":3,"text":"补偿动作","id":"补偿动作"},{"level":3,"text":"超时与悬挂","id":"超时与悬挂"},{"level":2,"text":"对账","id":"对账"},{"level":3,"text":"三层对账","id":"三层对账"},{"level":3,"text":"对账产出","id":"对账产出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"出价撤回与有效性规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/proxy-bid-anti-snipe/bid-withdraw-rule"},"next":{"title":"拍卖保证金与买家违约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-close-settle/auction-deposit-default"}}